name:Oratio solemnis 9 (pro paganis), the bidding;
office-part:Oratio;
book:Text Missale O.P. (1939), p. 173; inflexion marks (flex sign and colons) from Officium Hebdomadæ Sanctæ / Triduum O.P. (1927), p. 193;
commentary:Set to the Dominican tone for orations at Vespers, Lauds and Mass (Processionarium O.P. 1913, pp. 404-406). Rubric: "dicat sequentes Orationes, sine Dóminus vobíscum, hoc modo" and "In fine hujus Orationis non respondeatur Amen" (Missal p. 171), Orémus. Flectámus génua. Leváte. follow in op13-quad6f-flectamus (op13-quad6f-oremus for the 8th);
